<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine Inv, Kwong Sang Hong suspended.</title>
<headline>Peregrine Inv, Kwong Sang Hong suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Peregrine Investments Holdings Ltd and Kwong Sang Hong International Ltd was suspended at the companies' request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
